<p>President Trump sharply escalated US rhetoric toward Cuba on March 16, saying he expected to have &quot;the honor of taking Cuba in some form&quot; and that he could &quot;do anything&quot; he wanted with the island, even as Washington and Havana continued contacts. The remarks came as Cuba endured a nationwide blackout and a deepening fuel crisis, adding new strain to already sensitive bilateral talks.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/ljXt4Y_Vjlqof9dqavMo0WdoVitkF-cSLntchDITTZyBJiwTryRsQQbO0hIMoBbr8kJzqx37lstGXN4xxgIdgTzpwRogfGg5mhPXGIpIGgj9Bp8AD9rJ7vp0nsdkztRtbDMkMFc4NFf3liaDg1KLYV1dIKo215CvFoKQ1e-4Cm78YOfQZDlmKZEoNtdtUD5uZFYP4LV8O0BLGQ' alt='President Miguel Díaz-Canel of Cuba during a visit to Venezuela last year.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Policy shift: Politico reported that Trump&#x27;s latest language marked a harder turn from Friday, when he said a &quot;friendly takeover&quot; of Cuba could be possible.</li><li>Public but opaque diplomacy: The Financial Times reported that Trump confirmed discussions with Cuba but declined to say what the two sides were negotiating.</li><li>Collapse rhetoric: Politico reported that Trump said &quot;I think Cuba sees the end,&quot; casting the island&#x27;s government as close to collapse.</li><li>Embargo link: SCMP and NDTV connected Cuba&#x27;s total blackout to a crippling oil embargo imposed by Washington, tying the political standoff to the island&#x27;s energy breakdown.</li></ul><blockquote>Whether I free it, take it — I think I can do anything I want with it, you want to know the truth. - President Donald Trump</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Trump administration: The New York Times reported that US officials tied meaningful progress in the negotiations to a leadership change in Havana, telling Cuba that President Miguel Díaz-Canel would need to step down. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/16/world/americas/trump-cuba-president-diaz-canel.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>President Donald Trump: Politico reported that Trump said &quot;I think Cuba sees the end&quot; and described Cuba as a &quot;very weakened nation,&quot; signaling that he sees the island&#x27;s government as nearing collapse. (<a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/03/16/cuba-trump-change-power-00830949'>Politico</a>)</li><li>Cuban officials: A senior Cuban official told Boston.com that Havana would open the economy to foreign investors, suggesting Cuba is pairing negotiations with a signal of economic flexibility. (<a href='https://www.boston.com/news/politics/2026/03/16/trump-says-he-will-have-the-honor-of-taking-cuba/'>Boston.com</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/03/17/trump-says-it-would-be-a-great-honor-to-take-cuba-as-washington-presses-havana-in-talks'>Trump says it would be “a great honor” to “take Cuba” as Washington presses Havana in talks</a> - mercopress.com</li><li><a href='https://www.boston.com/news/politics/2026/03/16/trump-says-he-will-have-the-honor-of-taking-cuba/'>Trump says he will have the ‘honor’ of ‘taking Cuba’</a> - boston.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/16/world/americas/trump-cuba-president-diaz-canel.html'>Trump Administration Seeks to Remove Cuba’s President From Power During Negotiations</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/donald-trump-says-he-will-have-honour-of-taking-cuba-11225351#publisher=newsstand'>&quot;I Could Do Anything&quot;: Trump Says He Will Have &quot;Honour Of Taking Cuba&quot;</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/trump-says-he-can-do-anything-i-want-with-cuba'>Trump says he can do &#x27;anything I want&#x27; with Cuba</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ft.com/content/fc621071-0ecc-440d-beb0-aee688ca33da'>Donald Trump says he will have the ‘honour’ of ‘taking Cuba in some form’</a> - ft.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3346808/cubas-national-electric-grid-collapses-leaving-millions-without-power'>Trump vows to ‘take’ Cuba as island reels from total power blackout</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-says-he-can-do-anything-he-wants-with-cuba/article70751709.ece'>Trump says he can do ‘anything’ he wants with Cuba</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/trump-claims-us-will-have-the-honour-of-taking-cuba-as-country-plunges-into-darkness-13990193.html'>Trump claims US will have the &#x27;honour of taking Cuba&#x27; as country plunges into darkness</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/trump-says-he-can-do-%27anything-i-want%27-with-cuba'>Trump says &#x27;I can do anything I want&#x27; with Cuba</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.politico.com/news/2026/03/16/cuba-trump-change-power-00830949'>Trump says he expects to ‘take’ Cuba</a> - politico.com</li></ul>